+ffmpeg -y -i /tmp/td_output.mov -t 25 -r 24 -vf "crop=1280:720:0:280" /tmp/frames/frame_%06d.png
+```
+
+Large ProRes files (1-2GB) at 1280x1280 decode at ~3fps, so 25s of footage takes ~3 minutes to extract.
